{"version":1,"content":"<p>硬件爆料者Gotou_3rd透露，AMD面向高端市場的下一代Siren Halo APU可能同時配備獨立GDDR7顯存與LPDDR系統內存，不再完全依賴統一內存。LPDDR據稱仍會保留，但兩套內存池的容量、位寬和連接方式尚無確切消息。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586246.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T07:58:01.948889+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T07:43:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T07:51:22.554259+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T07:51:22.554259+00:00","content_hash":"27f7e32daa6f91dae4fb48ed6c42974ac46cf4748ebe13ddc79fe39500338a2b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}